# Iterate the site until isitagentready reports Level 5

## Step

Run `POST https://isitagentready.com/api/scan` with `format: "agent"` against `https://ratstack.sh`, fix failing applicable checks in `apps/mischief` (paths, headers, Link headers, well-known documents), redeploy, rescan; stop at Level 5 or when the only failures are the not-applicable set with their documented treatment.

Resolved when the smoke script prints Level 5 and the scan output is saved as an asset.
